| `preToolUse`            | Before each tool executes.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            | Yes — can allow, deny, or modify.                                                                | Fires. A decision of `"ask"` is treated as `"deny"` because no user is available to answer.                                                                   |
